// The flavour's look (its `look.toml`: the look of the window's own controls, one for the whole window; N-866): whether
// a change to it (kinds/text-change.kind) goes live at once. The system's alone: a text-change refuses a change to the
// look while a project's policy names this decision (coordd change.rs), so no project rules on it. The `//` line above
// each rule is the why its decision gives.

Fact look-read-option Identified by String
+look-read-option("Go").
+look-read-option("Read").
+look-read-option("No").

Decision look-read
  Options look-read-option

// An agent or the owner may change the window's look: live once it checks; the window says who changed it, and the
// way back.
Only for look-read:
  option == "Go"
